  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Brand introduction:</span></strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">FOUND IN NATURE, BOTTLED IN BERLIN.&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">SWYPE skin care brand creates the essentials you need using scientific expertise and only high-quality, organic ingredients. All our products are cruelty-free, vegan, non-toxic and effective. Our focus is on empowerment and freeing consumers from needless time-consuming beauty regimes.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"></span></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">Product description:</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>MAGIC CLEANSER</strong>&nbsp;removes impurities&nbsp;and makes your&nbsp;skin glow</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>POWER MOISTURISER</strong> moisturises,&nbsp;illuminates and&nbsp;smoothes the skin&nbsp;for 24 hours</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>SUPER LIFTER</strong> instantly tightens,&nbsp;reduces fine lines&nbsp;and wrinkles on&nbsp;your face</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>ULTRA PROTECTOR</strong> protects the skin from harmful UV damage</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>MEGA PEELING</strong>&nbsp;Gently exfoliates skin to highlight natural radiance. Free from abrasive particles that cause redness and irritation.</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\">USPs</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Formulated with&nbsp;organic, innovative&nbsp;and scientifically&nbsp;proven ingredients</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Plant-based,&nbsp;eco-friendly,&nbsp;cruelty-free,&nbsp;fragrance-free,&nbsp;hypoallergenic&nbsp;and vegan</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Honest products&nbsp;manufactured&nbsp;with love and care,&nbsp;locally in Berlin</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our smart aluminium tubes are travel and Insta-friendly, and also 100% recycable.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Payment terms</span></strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Affiliates will receive a 15% commission on every sale made through unique link or code. Payouts are made on a monthly basis through a convenient payment method, ensuring you receive your hard-earned commissions in a timely manner.<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Other information:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We say no to mineral oils, silicones, parabens, PEGs, and other nasties. And yes, to only good things in life.<br><strong>Our average basket is 100&euro;.</strong> We provide you with product samples, marketing materials and coupons.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p>",
